00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.620
Or, alright, this is not
what, you know, like,

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:55.590
I'm not gonna do this tomorrow.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:58.173
Because unfortunately we
use opiates, we get sick,

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.590
you know, alcoholics get sick,

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:02.423
you know.

00:09:02.423 --> 00:09:03.680
And that's just a fact of life.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.610
So getting clean, isn't
as easy as going to sleep

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.560
