far ahead for addicts to,

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:20.210
to even have hope, you know?

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.050
So, you know, it's just,

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.340
it's, it's really hard.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.600
And I don't think that we could do it

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.970
